soos authselect profile
========================
Custom authselect profile integrating soos facial biometric authentication
with standard system-auth and password-auth stacks.

Stack ordering strictly conforms to ARCHITECTURE.md §5:
1. pam_soos.so is called with [success=done default=ignore] timeout_ms=250 before pam_unix.so.
2. pam_unix.so performs standard password verification.
3. pam_soos.so event=password-failed timeout_ms=20 is invoked only upon pam_unix failure.
